#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:3
#: 0848944173f44ec59938bb56b3db0a37
msgid "定向空位（Targeted Vacancy）"
msgstr "Targeted Vacancy"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:5
#: 3f60b96dcd02405d842d43586ef4a447
msgid "**分类：** 缺陷"
msgstr "**Category:** Defects"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:7
#: b95b46303be249f3992f1832605d09ba
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:9
#: 527fd1d7222f4128b008d7920bc53002
msgid "按“元素 + 可选 group + 删除数量”规则选择候选原子，再随机删除具体位点。适合只生成某种元素、某些原子层或已有区域标签内的空位。"
msgstr ""
"Select candidate atoms using rules composed of an element, an optional `group`, and a"
" removal count, then randomly choose the specific sites to remove. This is suited to "
"generating vacancies only for a particular element, atomic layer, or pre-labeled "
"region."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:11
#: 00f09972e64243189c424cf847317bae
msgid "**定向空位：** 每条规则有自己的元素、group 和数量范围。"
msgstr "**Targeted Vacancy:** each rule has its own element, `group`, and count range."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:12
#: e10ce4bb211a4238a70a0a1792a7fd7e
msgid "**全局空位：** 所有原子共同采样，按整体数量或比例删除。"
msgstr "**Global Vacancy:** sample all atoms together and remove an overall count or fraction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:13
#: 8a0176af5a80466daaffb4c545da9392
msgid "**随机占位：** 改变位点上的元素，不删除原子。"
msgstr "**Random Occupancy:** change the element occupying a site without removing the atom."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:15
#: 89cc939018b64a65bff92851e33c250a
msgid "输出保留剩余原子的坐标、晶胞、PBC、逐原子数组和结构信息。"
msgstr ""
"The output preserves the coordinates, cell, PBC, per-atom arrays, and structure "
"metadata of the remaining atoms."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:17
#: 5c10a195ae9944d289fa15fb6d717361
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:19
#: 55f2d83ed83549be968c99c680ee09de
msgid "第 $r$ 条规则先得到候选集合"
msgstr "Rule $r$ first constructs the candidate set"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:21
#: 5c7de55688c74e1c9c0a7549d85bdcfc
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathcal I_r=\\{i\\mid Z_i=Z_r\\ \\text{且}\\ g_i\\in G_r\\},\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\mathcal I_r=\\{i\\mid Z_i=Z_r\\ \\text{ and }\\ g_i\\in G_r\\},\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:25
#: 8ac3c686bc294fa2a137d12ec9e02d71
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"其中 group 条件 $G_r$ 可留空。固定数量直接使用 $n_r$；随机范围先在整数闭区间 $[n_{r,\\min},n_{r,\\max}]$ 中抽取 "
"$n_r$。随后从当前仍可用的候选集合中无放回抽取位点。"
msgstr ""
"The group condition $G_r$ may be left empty. A fixed count uses $n_r$ directly; a "
"random range first draws $n_r$ from the closed integer interval "
"$[n_{r,\\min},n_{r,\\max}]$. Sites are then sampled without replacement from the "
"candidates still available."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:27
#: fc4b8902da26468485659aceeca526cc
msgid "单条固定规则最多有"
msgstr "A single fixed-count rule has at most"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:29
#: d472898455cb41e4b641a7fdd17290f8
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\binom{|\\mathcal I_r|}{n_r}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:33
#: d647b5c4cd8d40ae88748b6910e3dac5
msgid "种删除组合。多条规则按界面顺序执行；若候选池重叠，后面的规则只能使用前面尚未删除的原子，因此预览显示的是组合数上限，实际唯一输出可能更少。所有结果按删除位点集合去重，并保证至少留下一个原子。"
msgstr ""
"possible removal combinations. Multiple rules run in interface order. If their "
"candidate pools overlap, a later rule can use only atoms not already removed by "
"earlier rules, so the preview is an upper bound on the number of combinations and the"
" actual number of unique outputs may be smaller. Results are deduplicated by their "
"sets of removed sites, and at least one atom is always retained."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:35
#: c40852ae76d5429cbf0422470897d22c
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:37
#: b4a64674a3ab4d57b2d7c00ce159987c
msgid "只生成表面氧空位"
msgstr "Generate Surface Oxygen Vacancies Only"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:39
#: a48e544411514ecfb43ffb2fa227c90e
msgid "输入结构含 `group=surface/bulk`。设置一条规则："
msgstr "The input structure contains `group=surface/bulk`. Add one rule:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:41
#: b561ec407a134051bfe6269ee4719109
msgid ""
"元素：O\n"
"已有 group：surface\n"
"数量模式：随机范围\n"
"数量：1–3\n"
msgstr ""
"Element: O\n"
"Existing group: surface\n"
"Count mode: Random range\n"
"Count: 1–3\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:48
#: f419ff75568641d68b94ea1e536b8b71
msgid "将“每个输入最大输出数”设为 20。首帧预览会显示匹配的表面 O 数量、删除范围和输出上限；运行后每个结果删除 1–3 个表面 O，并追加 `Vac(n=...)` 标签。"
msgstr ""
"Set `Maximum outputs per input` to 20. The first-frame preview shows the number of "
"matching surface O atoms, the removal range, and the output upper bound. After the "
"run, each result has 1–3 surface O atoms removed and receives a `Vac(n=...)` label."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:50
#: 31dc95ec794f4364af45f180722b3a07
msgid "若要同时删除 1 个 Li，可再添加一条 Li 规则。两条规则若使用同一候选池，界面会提示实际输出可能低于组合数上限。"
msgstr ""
"To remove one Li atom at the same time, add another rule for Li. If two rules use the"
" same candidate pool, the interface warns that the actual output count may be below "
"the combination upper bound."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:52
#: 22e5cfaee10a472a9b005c57612de14d
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:54
#: 51b24187100b49cb8a562c6470a29ebe
msgid "空位规则（rules）"
msgstr "Vacancy Rules (rules)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:56
#: d8f73705d1ba4981a3f28ee8eadac1d4
msgid "`list[dict]`，默认空列表。每条规则包含："
msgstr "`list[dict]`, an empty list by default. Each rule contains:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md
#: 9ad2f4774e524d8e9cdcb0261bdb7814
msgid "字段"
msgstr "Field"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md
#: f2743a6c18174ae09079accbbacfbfc8
msgid "说明"
msgstr "Description"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md
#: e33402102a044b12936e6b3809c9103e
msgid "`element`"
msgstr "`element`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md
#: 6304e37ba5fd4bd1b88ced13678ac4d0
msgid "要删除的元素，如 `O`"
msgstr "Element to remove, such as `O`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md
#: 2c6aaef257f545de987bb644c7fa7ffb
msgid "`group`"
msgstr "`group`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md
#: 710256b7ffdc4175bbd5ecf2a2f182f3
msgid "可选；输入中已有的一个或多个 `group` 标签"
msgstr "Optional; one or more existing `group` labels in the input"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md
#: 7e514c5581b7407d8702abf276cac6fe
msgid "`count_mode`"
msgstr "`count_mode`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md
#: 7330064f68ee4ba8826f3230d823f4c5
msgid "`fixed` 或 `random`"
msgstr "`fixed` or `random`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md
#: 89724087284644f88c818dc0afc997e3
msgid "`count`"
msgstr "`count`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md
#: feb127c23a8743bf9fcea977862b5a17
msgid "固定数量写 `[n,n]`；随机范围写 `[min,max]`"
msgstr "Use `[n,n]` for a fixed count and `[min,max]` for a random range"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:65
#: 8190515873f145348026295c279ed7a3
msgid "固定数量至少为 1。随机范围的最小值可以为 0；抽到 0 时，该规则不删除原子。如果所有规则都抽到 0，原结构会作为一个唯一输出保留，且不会追加 `Vac` 标签。"
msgstr ""
"A fixed count must be at least 1. The minimum of a random range may be 0; drawing 0 "
"means that rule removes no atoms. If every rule draws 0, the original structure is "
"retained as one unique output and no `Vac` label is appended."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:67
#: 10b5de9aca674aedb93e84d2e661b671
msgid "最大结构数（max_structures）"
msgstr "max_structures"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:69
#: 7c6bd42015bd49959db985dda0aadc10
msgid "`int`，默认 1。每个输入最多保留的唯一空位结构数。候选组合不足、规则重叠或随机尝试重复时，实际输出会更少。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 1. The maximum number of unique vacancy structures retained per input."
" The actual count may be smaller when there are too few candidate combinations, rules"
" overlap, or random attempts repeat a previous result."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:71
#: 4af2d3ee7a334b5d9ad0db1c055e9474
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "Use Random Seed (use_seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:73
#: 16a006187ea343c789a8a7e4cde4e926
msgid "`bool`，默认 `false`。开启后，相同输入结构和参数产生相同删除结果。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. When enabled, the same input structure and parameters "
"produce the same removal results."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:75
#: b527423d7d7b4bf9aa45a825fa987f3e
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "Random Seed (seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:77
#: a0143e1a9e024cbba8eb5465983768a9
msgid "`int`，默认 0，仅在 `use_seed=true` 时使用。种子会结合结构内容派生，因此不同输入帧不会机械删除相同的原子序号。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 0, used only when `use_seed=true`. The seed is combined with the "
"structure content, so different input frames do not mechanically remove atoms with "
"the same indices."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:79
#: 61a5561bcb154ce3ab14350d673720e6
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:81
#: 9cf0139f8af34cf6a7388fcd7fae2186
msgid "`Layer Groups → Targeted Vacancy`：只在交替原子层中的某一组删位。"
msgstr ""
"`Layer Groups → Targeted Vacancy`: remove sites only from one group of alternating "
"atomic layers."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:82
#: 1d5f99de90284d71913bc7152bb51fb1
msgid "`Super Cell → Targeted Vacancy`：先增大晶胞，降低周期空位镜像间的相互作用。"
msgstr ""
"`Super Cell → Targeted Vacancy`: enlarge the cell first to reduce interactions "
"between periodic vacancy images."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:83
#: ab45a8b56612453da1f619dff13f9a97
msgid "`Targeted Vacancy → FPS Filter`：大量生成后筛选代表性构型。"
msgstr ""
"`Targeted Vacancy → FPS Filter`: select representative configurations after "
"generating a large set."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:85
#: a2816203cfde4d898886d9bab6680670
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:87
#: 364a9f0dd5fb450f89f3f14c39cee61c
msgid "**填写 group 后提示输入没有 group 数组。** group 必须由输入结构或上游卡片提前写入；不需要区域限制时清空该字段。"
msgstr ""
"**The interface says the input has no `group` array after a group is entered.** The "
"`group` array must already be present in the input or be written by an upstream card."
" Clear this field when no regional restriction is needed."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:89
#: 21b9345b83934871bb403a592cd6160d
msgid "**预览显示“组合数上限”。** 多条规则共享候选原子时，不同抽取顺序可能得到相同的最终删除集合，因此实际唯一输出通常更少。"
msgstr ""
"**The preview shows a `combination upper bound`.** When multiple rules share "
"candidate atoms, different sampling sequences can produce the same final set of "
"removed sites, so the actual number of unique outputs is often smaller."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:91
#: 939f83edf2dd4e528b80914c2ac798a8
msgid "**随机范围从 0 开始时为什么出现原结构？** 0 表示该规则本次不删除原子。若不希望保留原结构，把范围最小值改为 1。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the original structure appear when a random range starts at 0?** Zero "
"means that the rule removes no atoms in that draw. Set the range minimum to 1 if the "
"original structure should not be retained."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:93
#: 6b4ac05ea25645f4b6a97a6af738d484
msgid "**为什么运行失败而不是自动减少删除数？** 请求数量超过候选数或会删空整个结构时，程序明确失败，避免生成与参数不一致的数据。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the operation fail instead of automatically reducing the removal count?** "
"When the requested count exceeds the number of candidates or would remove every atom,"
" the operation fails explicitly rather than generating data inconsistent with the "
"parameters."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:95
#: 171e28831f7f4c41be29781c57095f5d
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:97
#: e62e7cc4a05f4688a1fb54eb731f7e42
msgid "实际删除原子时，`Config_type` 追加："
msgstr "When atoms are actually removed, the following is appended to `Config_type`:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:99
#: d6baaf24f7764b8e9de4947f4af9cacb
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Vac(n={删除原子总数})\n"
msgstr "Vac(n={total number of removed atoms})\n"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "按规则表对指定元素原子做删除操作，生成可控的空位缺陷结构。每条规则精确控制\"删除什么元素、删多少个、在哪个 region "
#~ "删\"，支持元素过滤和 group 区域约束。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Generate controlled vacancies by removing atoms "
#~ "according to explicit rules. Each rule "
#~ "specifies the element, count, and optional "
#~ "group region."

#~ msgid "`Random Vacancy`：规则驱动，按元素+group 精确删除位点，适合定向研究某类空位缺陷"
#~ msgstr "`Random Vacancy` targets element and group rules for a specific vacancy family."

#~ msgid "**输入：** 一个 LiCoO2 的 slab 结构，已经用 `Group Label` 标记了表面层和体相的 group"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Input:** A LiCoO2 slab whose surface and "
#~ "bulk regions were marked with `Group Label`."

#~ msgid "`Use Seed`：勾选，`Seed`：`[42]`"
#~ msgstr "Enable `Use Seed` and set `Seed` to `[42]`."

#~ msgid "**输出：** 20 个空位结构，每帧中 1~3 个表面氧被删除，带 `Vac(n=...)` 标签"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output:** Twenty structures with 1-3 surface "
#~ "O atoms removed, labeled `Vac(n=...)`."

#~ msgid "`list[dict[str, Any]]`，默认空列表。在界面里写简化语法即可，程序会自动转成 JSON。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`list[dict[str, Any]]`, empty by default. The "
#~ "interface accepts simplified rule syntax and "
#~ "converts it to JSON."

#~ msgid "`fixed` 精确删除 `count[0]` 个原子；`random` 在 `count[0]..count[1]` 之间随机"
#~ msgstr "`fixed` removes exactly `count[0]`; `random` samples from `count[0]..count[1]`"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "限制只删除特定 group 标签内的原子。需要输入有 `atoms.arrays['group']`。界面里写成 "
#~ "`surface_top,surface_bottom`"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Restrict removal to listed group labels. Input"
#~ " must contain `atoms.arrays['group']`; enter labels "
#~ "such as `surface_top,surface_bottom`."

#~ msgid "规则为空时，卡片不产生任何删除，输出 = 输入。"
#~ msgstr "With no rules, no atoms are removed and output equals input."

#~ msgid "多条规则按顺序执行。如果两条规则操作同一个元素，第二条会在第一条的结果上继续删除——别设计互相冲突的规则。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Rules execute in order. A later rule "
#~ "targeting the same element sees the result "
#~ "of earlier removals; avoid conflicting rules."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 1。每输入帧生成多少个空位版本。"
#~ msgstr "`int`, default `1`. Number of vacancy variants generated per input frame."

#~ msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后同一输入 + 同一参数 + 同一 seed → 完全相同的删除结果。对比实验时开，探索阶段关。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default `false`. Enable to reproduce "
#~ "removals from the same input, parameters, and"
#~ " seed."

#~ msgid "`Group Label` → `Random Vacancy`：先标记 surface/bulk group，再定向删位"
#~ msgstr "`Group Label` -> `Random Vacancy`: mark surface and bulk before targeted removal"

#~ msgid "**输出和输入一样，没有删除。** 检查 rules 是否为空、element 是否真的存在于输入结构中、group 过滤是否把候选位点全滤掉了。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output is unchanged.** Check for nonempty "
#~ "rules, an element present in the input, "
#~ "and group filters that leave eligible sites."

#~ msgid "**删完骨架塌缩。** 检查 count 上限是否太长。在 20 原子小胞里删 10 个必然崩。先扩胞再删。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**The framework collapses after removal.** The "
#~ "count is too large for the cell. Expand"
#~ " first or reduce the vacancy amount."

#~ msgid "**多条规则交互异常。** 规则顺序执行。如果一条规则删了大量原子，下一条规则的候选池可能已经变了。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Rules interact unexpectedly.** They execute "
#~ "sequentially, so early removals change the "
#~ "candidate pool seen by later rules."

#~ msgid "勾选 `use_seed` + 固定 `seed` → 相同输入可复现。输入结构顺序变化也会影响结果，建议把 seed 与 pipeline 配置一起版本化。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Enable `use_seed` and fix `seed` for "
#~ "reproducibility. Input order also matters, so "
#~ "version the seed with the pipeline "
#~ "configuration."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "按规则从指定元素的候选位点中均匀随机选择原子并删除。每条规则控制“删除哪种元素、删除多少个、是否限制在已有 `group` "
#~ "标签内”；没有被删除的原子坐标、晶胞和 PBC 保持不变。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Uniformly sample and delete atoms from "
#~ "candidate sites of specified elements. Each "
#~ "rule controls which element to delete, how "
#~ "many atoms to delete, and whether to "
#~ "restrict sites to an existing `group`; "
#~ "coordinates, cell, and PBC of retained atoms"
